Office layout for Herdr
Copyright 2026 khoenv

Derived from herdr-traveler (https://github.com/franky5440-afk/herdr-traveler),
Copyright 2026 Frank Lin, Apache License 2.0. mods/office-spaces,
mods/office-tabs and mods/office-chrome are modified copies of that project's
traveler-spaces, traveler-tabs and traveler-chrome, which are themselves
derived from the built-in mods spaces, tabs and workspace-chrome of Herdr
0.1.11 (Apache License 2.0). mods/office-inbox, layouts/office.json and
themes/office-night.json are adapted from the same project's traveler
equivalents; mods/office-agents started as one and has since been rewritten.

Changes: fantasy RPG theme replaced with a modern office theme; roles, data
paths, image paths and mod names renamed from traveler-* to office-*; comments
translated to English; spaces drawn as project folders; the agent cards and
their HP/SP status line replaced by one shared office with a desk per pane.

The shared-office idea is inspired by herdr-office-layout
(https://github.com/zuccs/herdr-office-layout) and Sit & Watch
(https://github.com/funny-it-worked-last-time-gsv/herdr-sit-and-watch-layout),
both MIT licensed. No code or art is copied from either.

All images are generated by tools/build-art.py in code (no image model) and are
covered by the Apache License 2.0 of this repo, unlike the upstream kit's
Meta-AI images.
